<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Moderna started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Moderna started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- ING Barings analyst Ana Maria Mendez has started coverage of Mexican conglomerate Empresas La Moderna SA de CV with a rating of hold.</p>
<p>-- In a May 13 analysis, she wrote, &quot;Despite the doubling in adjusted earnings in both 1997 and 1998 we believe the stock is expensive.&quot;</p>
<p>-- She set a 12-month price target for the company's American Depositary Receipt of $22.21.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We anticipate that adjusted (earnings per share) in 1997 and 1998 will reach $0.324 and $0.704, respectively.&quot;</p>
<p>-- The ADRs closed at 20-1/2 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
